    "Apple / iCloud" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple / iCloud"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple / iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As the owner, use the disconnect icon to stop sharing with others. Your list is kept and remains stored in your account. For a received list, Leave removes only your own access. The trash icon permanently deletes a list you own and its items, including for all participants when the list is shared. Signing out ends your session and does not revoke sharing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit dem Trennen-Symbol beendest du als Besitzer die Freigabe für andere; deine Liste bleibt erhalten und weiterhin in deinem Konto gespeichert. Bei einer empfangenen Liste beendet Verlassen nur deinen eigenen Zugriff. Der Papierkorb löscht eine eigene Liste samt Artikeln dauerhaft, bei geteilten Listen auch für alle Teilnehmer. Abmelden beendet lediglich die Anmeldung und hebt keine Freigabe auf."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As the owner, use the disconnect icon to stop sharing with others. Your list is kept and remains stored in your account. For a received list, Leave removes only your own access. The trash icon permanently deletes a list you own and its items, including for all participants when the list is shared. Signing out ends your session and does not revoke sharing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
