    },
    "System follows the device setting; Light and Dark override it for this app. In Settings, choose a background color or your own photo and adjust opacity to keep backed text and list elements readable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "System übernimmt die Geräteeinstellung; Hell und Dunkel überschreiben sie für diese App. In den Einstellungen kannst du eine Hintergrundfarbe oder ein eigenes Foto wählen und die Deckkraft für gut lesbare hinterlegte Elemente anpassen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "System follows the device setting; Light and Dark override it for this app. In Settings, choose a background color or your own photo and adjust opacity to keep backed text and list elements readable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app uses Google Firebase as an external service provider for accounts, connected lists, invitations and sign-in links. Firebase Authentication processes your email address, sign-in information and technical connection data. This authentication service operates in the United States.\n\nCloud Firestore stores connected list names, items, quantities, purchase status, timestamps, user identifiers and invited email addresses. The list database is located in Frankfurt. Participants can see the email addresses within their shared list.\n\nBackground photos and appearance settings are not uploaded to Firebase. Firebase Analytics is not included in this app. With iCloud sync enabled on iPhone, lists, background photos and appearance settings can also sync through your private Apple account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für Konten, geteilte Listen sowie Einladungs- und Anmeldelinks verwendet die App Google Firebase als externen Dienstleister. Firebase Authentication verarbeitet E-Mail-Adresse, Anmeldedaten und technische Verbindungsdaten. Dieser Anmeldedienst arbeitet in den USA.\n\nCloud Firestore speichert verbundene Listennamen, Artikel, Mengen, Kaufstatus, Zeitpunkte, Benutzerkennungen und freigegebene E-Mail-Adressen. Die Listendatenbank liegt in Frankfurt. Teilnehmer können die E-Mail-Adressen innerhalb ihrer geteilten Liste sehen.\n\nHintergrundbilder und Darstellungseinstellungen werden nicht an Firebase übertragen. Firebase Analytics ist in dieser App nicht eingebunden. Bei aktivierter iCloud-Synchronisierung auf dem iPhone können Listen, Hintergrundfotos und Darstellungseinstellungen außerdem über deinen privaten Apple-Account synchronisiert werden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app uses Google Firebase as an external service provider for accounts, connected lists, invitations and sign-in links. Firebase Authentication processes your email address, sign-in information and technical connection data. This authentication service operates in the United States.\n\nCloud Firestore stores connected list names, items, quantities, purchase status, timestamps, user identifiers and invited email addresses. The list database is located in Frankfurt. Participants can see the email addresses within their shared list.\n\nBackground photos and appearance settings are not uploaded to Firebase. Firebase Analytics is not included in this app. With iCloud sync enabled on iPhone, lists, background photos and appearance settings can also sync through your private Apple account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
